      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve wanted something similar to this a few times, but I thought there was a design decision behind the lack of support for it. Judging from existing patterns, a more consistent approach would be to instead add BaseModuleContext.LinkType(), similar to the existing Arch(), Os(), etc.",
